{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、「虹のプレリュード」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事初日終えました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてお客さんに観ていただくということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心臓が常にゆらゆらしながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しみながらやることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーテンコールではみなさんの反応が温かくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝でいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演はあと3日で終わってしまいますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中でもっとのばしていけるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/10/03/9749065/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冒頭と最後の女の子の格好。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルイズ・ルネ・現代の女の子、と3役やっているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早着替えや早カツラ替えがすさまじいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回焦りながらも楽しんでます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は2日目！ がんばるぞ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}